## Required Darwin — loop1 cheap, 150× binds still >45s

Loop2 (`check_mod.oo`): every non-empty body → `run_check_core_binds` =
`lex_all` **then** `tokenize_lines` (lex again + List) + secret + **25** TC
walks. Graph ~153. p7 is **cold** (`timeout 45`).

| Path | Close | Hon | Smoke | Ent | Ship | Avg | Verdict |
|------|------:|----:|------:|----:|-----:|----:|---------|
| **A cache / module** | 4 | 8 | 4 | 7 | 8 | **6.2** | Belt. Not p7 close. |
| **B raise to measured** | 8 | 9 | 9 | 8 | 10 | **8.8** | Winner **iff** measured. |
| **C skip typecheck** | 6 | 0 | 3 | 0 | 7 | **3.2** | **FAIL-OPEN / REJECT** |

### A — cache per module

`check_cache_mod_key` exists. After a **full** binds check, put
`m_<hash(body)+hash(binds)>`. Hit skips that body.

Why A loses as close: cold p7 still pays 153× tokenize+TC. Body-only key
= **FAIL-OPEN** when `extra_binds` change (undef / import names). Warm
hit can **hide a hang** (Pride). Smoke must not use `.ooda-cache`.

### B — raise smoke to measured finish

Isolated `timeout 180 check oodac/main.oo`. Write **wall + peak RSS**.
If it **finishes** and RSS **<< 1.8GiB**: p7 timeout = measured×1.2.
Hang → named **cost**. Harness already forbids a raise with no wall
(`f26_harness.oot`).

Reject B if no finish, or RSS ≈ 1.8GiB (old tokenize host — **wait the
in-flight rebuild**, do not start another).

### C — skip typecheck / skip loop2

**FAIL-OPEN / REJECT.** That function **is** the type + secret +
`check_residual_free_calls` floor. “Names only” / “keep secret, drop TC”
still prints OK without the type floor. Same class as silent stubs.
SCIENCE: fail-closed. SINS #3 Pride.

**Ship if loop2 >45s:** measure → try **I12** first (may beat 45s) →
**B** if still finite+bounded → **A** as warm belt (strong key). **C dies.**

